# Raw source datasets — 1.4GB, downloaded by scripts, never committed.
# The *derived* artifacts (src/data/*.generated.json) are committed instead:
# they are small, reviewable, and what the app actually ships.
# Re-fetch with the commands in README.md, then `npm run build:catalog` and
# `npm run build:priors`.
/data-raw/

